{"id":"855a609cbd7dcf03","group":"88","path":"88/88-ex-completeness-proof.md","title":"Completeness Proof Outline","display":"ex-completeness-proof — Completeness Proof Outline","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-ex-completeness-proof","aliases":["88-ex-completeness-proof"],"display":"ex-completeness-proof — Completeness Proof Outline","depends_on":["[[88-thm-completeness]]","[[88-df-canonical-model]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-logical-consequence]]","[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","[[88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-ex-completeness-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-ex-completeness-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-completeness-proof — Completeness Proof Outline"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f3ef5718562a673\" href=\"?note=2f3ef5718562a673\" title=\"88-thm-completeness\">88-thm-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19f597e8b5469bbc\" href=\"?note=19f597e8b5469bbc\" title=\"88-df-canonical-model\">88-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b906e83ff9b25155\" href=\"?note=b906e83ff9b25155\" title=\"88-df-logical-consequence\">88-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"95213b573c0bce18\" href=\"?note=95213b573c0bce18\" title=\"88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness\">88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (standard first-order proof calculus)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)\\)</span> 的公理与规则包含条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}\\)</span> 并不提供这些逻辑规则。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所用具体演算的完备性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"95213b573c0bce18\" href=\"?note=95213b573c0bce18\" title=\"88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness\">88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}proof} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\Phi\\nvdash_R\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\not\\models\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}proof} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\Phi\\nvdash_R\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\not\\models\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这是完全性证明的逆否形式：不可证时构造反模型。</li>\n<li>证明方法仍可先取包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\Phi\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\}\\)</span>的最大一致 Henkin\n扩张，再用其典范模型；但中间扩张不应在没有形式化性质时冒充结论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-thm-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"2f3ef5718562a673","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"19f597e8b5469bbc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id"